> I'd really like to get some help figuring out if this is a toolchain bug or
> something I can remedy on my end to fix
> https://buildd.debian.org/fetch.cgi?pkg=scribus-ng;ver=1.3.5.dfsg%2Bsvn20091216-2;arch=alpha;stamp=1261076779

Chances are this is an instance of a toolchain bug with the --relax option
that was turned on in ld by default a few binutils releases back, and can be
worked around by passing -Wl,--no-relax to gcc as part of LDFLAGS or
equivalent.

